WEBVTT

00:01:30.542 --> 00:01:33.434
And so I come to you today
not as a researcher

00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:35.851
or an educator or a guru

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.268
or even a life coach,

00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:40.684
but as a student of Bruce Lee --

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.184
as his daughter,

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:45.750
and also as a student of my own life.

00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:48.476
So ...

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.601
my big burning question that I want
you all to consider today is ...

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:55.000
how are you?

00:01:55.792 --> 00:01:57.042
Let me elaborate.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:02.559
Whenever anyone would ask my mom
what my father was like,